  "如果用户写的已经是详细英文提示词，就只做微调，不要改变他的意图。": "If what the user wrote is already a detailed English prompt, only fine-tune it and do not change their intent.",
  "这是 ensoul.desktop-ui.v1 声明式桌面组件。用 desktop_ui 工具更新 JSON 配置；不要写源码、CSS、构建或重启。": "This is a declarative desktop component (ensoul.desktop-ui.v1). Update its JSON configuration with the desktop_ui tool; do not write source code, CSS, build or restart.",
  "这是 ensoul.desktop-ui.v1 声明式桌面组件。用 desktop_ui 工具更新 JSON 配置；不要写源码、CSS、构建或重启。桌面只显示功能内容，样式、缩放和交互由目录实现。": "This is a declarative desktop component (ensoul.desktop-ui.v1). Update its JSON configuration with the desktop_ui tool; do not write source code, CSS, build or restart. The desktop shows only the functional content — styling, scaling and interaction come from the catalog.",
  "**会话边界就这一个数**：eschat（员工通讯录）不再有自己的一份，它切\"当前这一次\"读的就是这个值。隔了这么久没续上，就归入新的一次会话 —— 老的进右上角会话记录、并把这一段收进面板左边的历史抽屉。": "**This single number is the session boundary**: eschat (the agent roster) no longer keeps its own copy — this is the value it reads to decide \"the current session\". If nothing follows for this long, it counts as a new session: the old one goes to the session record in the top right, and that stretch is collected into the history drawer on the left of the panel.",
